@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Guest / User" as User
participant "ForgotPasswordPage / ResetPasswordPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "AccountController" as Controller
participant "AccountService" as Service
participant "AppUserRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-06: Forgot and Reset Password ==

User -> UI : 1. Submit email or new password from reset link
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. sendResetLink() / submitReset()
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. POST /api/account/forgot-password\nPOST /api/account/reset-password
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. forgotPassword(request) / resetPassword(request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. Issue 1-hour token; validate single-use token
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. findByEmail(email) / findById(userId)
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT app_user; UPDATE reset token/password
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. AppUser or empty
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Send reset email; clear token; revoke JWTs
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Invalid/expired token -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 15. setForgotResult / setResetResult
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 16. Show neutral email notice or reset success
deactivate App

UI --> User : 17. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
